@description Lukashev Graphite (REAPER theme)
@version 38
@author Ilia Lukashev
@changelog
  TCP insert column ruled with thin lines like the mixer
  No stray empty knob circles next to TCP sends (empty FX-parameter slots hidden)
  Arrange grid lines visible again (fixed grid draw modes)
  Softer, more pastel item backgrounds
  Item colours follow the track colour exactly: neutral base, wash and selection (no blue cast)
  Item background lightly tinted to the track colour (pastel), peaks in full track colour
  Black outline drawn around peaks and waveforms
  Waveform peaks in track/item/take colour on a neutral item background (Pro Tools style)
  No send knob on empty send rows (TCP and MCP); black waveform outline
  Mixer: selected strip marked over its full height (blue wash + accent edges)
  Slightly deeper indicator colours (FX/rec/routing); mute and solo keep full brightness
  Arrange grid: subtle measure/beat/sub-beat lines
  Mixer insert area ruled with thin lines; TCP FX slots centred vertically
@provides
  Lukashev Graphite 38.ReaperThemeZip
@about
  Minimal, high-res theme based on Default 7 with Apple HIG-inspired colours,
  a light arrange area and flat controls for long, comfortable sessions.
  After installing: Options > Themes > Lukashev Graphite 38.
